{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_st03",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_03",
  "title": "Empty Street",
  "storyCode": "SN-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0e2d4bf80749a1b2957bf1be1d1118680162be0a9f2d6ff471a3138938115fa5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "text": "Irene.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "text": "Yes, maestro... I mean, sir!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "text": "You seem distracted.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "text": "I... I'm fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "text": "Gran Faro is a tiny town, so small that most maps don't even bother to list it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "text": "But this is a request from Lord Carmen himself, and it involves Dr. Kal'tsit and those Ægir.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "text": "I know, sir. I—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "text": "If you still haven't found your answer, I will not give you permission to join the mission.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "text": "I'd already made up my mind when I first decided to follow in your footsteps and become an Inquisitor.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "text": "Yes, before you even knew the question. An answer is worthless if it cannot explain what you see and hear.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Inquisitor",
      "text": "Don't die a worthless death, Irene. You know what we're fighting against. And you must find your own answer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "text": "I—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inquisitor Irene",
      "text": "...Yes, sir.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "Lady Kal'tsit.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gladiia's tone does not change, but her footsteps reflect her mood.\nA blink of the eye, and she is by Kal'tsit's side."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Good work, Gladiia.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "The Inquisition didn't do anything to you, did they?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "The fact that Iberia has not yet sunk into the sea is proof that they still retain a shred of humility and vigilance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "You found a way, as promised.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Yes. However...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Even if Iberia is willing to let go of their fears, what about Ægir?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "What about you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "If this temporary cooperation is necessary to help us return to the ocean... so be it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Finally, an Ægir with some sense, right? Like the waves themselves, like the rays and texture of the sea.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Hello there, special Ægir. I believe you've already met our other members?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "Yes. You're also a member of AUS?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Alty, bassist. Nice to meet you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "How are things outside?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "The cultists are out in force, but individually they're rather weak.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "My Hunters can take care of everything.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "The Inquisition will only work with us once we've taken care of the problems in Gran Faro.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "Then there's no time to waste.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gladiia raises her lance.\nAt the same time, she senses that something is not right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "......!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "There, among the Sea Terrors... but how could it be...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Kal'tsit here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit! Their goal is—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "...Elysium?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "What's the matter?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "One of our operators is in trouble.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gladiia",
      "text": "Something lurks here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "As we discussed, Alty, the members of AUS can stay ashore.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "We'll handle this as quickly as possible.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Sure, we can wait.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "And we'll be happy to provide some BGM for your campaign.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "...Too weak.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "They keep coming. Buying time?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "Or spreading... something.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "I must find the leader.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sea Terror",
      "text": "—Gkh—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "Specter.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "...Hm?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "Ah... Skadi. Long time no see.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "Something the matter?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "...Are you alright?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "I'm fine, just a little tired.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "Yes... We're fighting, right? The scent of the ocean... reminds me of home.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "But, home? My home... huh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sea Terror",
      "text": "Gkh—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "The sea.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "The scent of the sea grows stronger. Are we home, Skadi? Is this the way home?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "...It will be, Specter. Laurentina. I promise.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "Tell me then... what's that before my eyes?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A figure strides down the street, humming a tune.\nThe streets are a mess in the aftermath of the panicking townsfolk, but it hardly bothers Frost as she plucks at the air and imagines music."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "Hmph!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sea Terror",
      "text": "(Slithering sounds)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "The Sea Terrors keep away from her. No, they ignore her. Is she... playing an instrument?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "Does it sound nice?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "I don't know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "Then ask.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "text": "Wait!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "*pant*... *pant*...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "(Did I shake him?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "Dammit?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "Was it when we first met? No, he didn't even touch me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "text": "Those documents must be destroyed, Iberian.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "text": "Obey, and you may keep your limbs. Attached, if you prefer.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "(Shit, he's fast...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "Weren't your friends only burning them because there wasn't time to save them all?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "With your skills, you could just as easily have taken them yourself. So why the need to burn them?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "text": "'Friends?'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The man growls from the bottom of his throat, a sound born of humiliation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "text": "We are not 'friends.'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "Then what?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "text": "It doesn't concern you. Surrender the documents, and leave this place.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "text": "Whether you're with the Inquisition, or with another country...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "text": "......!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "(He stopped.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "text": "Yes... you've always been sharp.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The mysterious Ægir gazes into the distance.\n'Friends.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "text": "(Ægirian) We may be bound by blood, but you must stay away from Ægir for now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "—!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Elysium evades the attack, but it's immediately clear why he managed to.\nThe sword's aura rips the charred papers to shreds, sending the splintered truth drifting into the wind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Elysium",
      "text": "Crap—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "text": "(Ægirian) They cannot return to Ægir just yet. Allowing everyone to act on their own will only accelerate the destruction.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ulpianus",
      "text": "(Ægirian) Even though Ægir has already chosen the path of self-annihilation.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "No more Sea Terrors approach.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "Unsurprising numbers, for the coast. Now, where are you hiding?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "You... *cough* No! Not the lantern!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "Answer me. What do you intend for Gran Faro?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "That lantern! Get it off me—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "Answer me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "Ugh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "It... It's...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "What are you pointing at?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Carmen looks back in the direction that the cultist is indicating."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A statue stands in the middle of the square."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "Ah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "Gran Faro. The Great Lighthouse. Of course. You're seeking the lighthouse of Gran Faro.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "Stop... stop it... ugh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "The nobles once called those great monuments the Eye of Iberia. Dozens of them once stood on Iberia's coastline.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "Even had the Witch King's Tower in Leithanien not been toppled, it would still have been dwarfed by these guardians of the sea.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "They are the single greatest mark that human civilization has ever left on this land.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "The sea... *cough* the Eye of Iberia...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "The miracle... destroyed the sacrilege... argh... take that lantern away!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "The Profound Silence destroyed most of the lighthouses, and disabled the rest.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "What are you plotting?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "I see. So you knew...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "You knew that one remained operational. That the goal of the Gran Faro project was to protect what was left of the Eye of Iberia.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "That's why you've been lurking here, awaiting your chance.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "You...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "I never expected there to be traitors in the very heart of the Inquisition. Where are they?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "Ha... hehehe...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "While you're here... babbling away...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Wounded Cultist",
      "text": "Look under your feet... and come face to face... with your pathetic... narrow-mindedness...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dying Sea Terror",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dying Sea Terror",
      "text": "(Unsettling slithering sounds)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "Hm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "The Sea Terrors are... glowing?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "What is this luminescence?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Get away from it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saint Carmen",
      "text": "Ah—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Mon3tr!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "text": "(Impatient growling)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kal'tsit",
      "text": "Meltdown.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "text": "(Agitated roars)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "Hello.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "(Peaceful riff)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "There is a familiar scent on you... Do you know what it is?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "(Spirited riff)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "A pleasant melody, but not the one that I know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "Then, how does the one you know go?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "When she prayed, the stars ceased to shimmer♪\nWhen she wept, the night let out a smile♪\nWhen she laments, the anguish sprawled upon her madness♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "...A song of Ægir. A sad song.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "But I don't like it. It belongs in the past. It lacks passion, and wallows in futile sentimentality—the same as Ægir itself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "A shame.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "You've come home, Ægir.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "Home? Me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "Sing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "In song, you will rediscover yourself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "Song?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "What memories will singing recall?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "Just sing. You will encounter your past. You must eventually find and face your destiny, or it will find you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "That's how it has ever been, since I left the ocean.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "What a strange woman. But I don't mind singing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "Then sing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "La la la, la la la♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "When she prays, the stars ceased to shimmer♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "text": "As always, there's such sorrow in your song.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Specter",
      "text": "Who are... you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amaia",
      "text": "I never imagined we'd meet again in such circumstances, Laurentina.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
